mphasis on theory, and insufficient attention given to applications.\nSeveral topics cover in this book are:\no	Introduction to information systems development\no	Managing the application development portfolio\no	Requirements analysis and determination\no	Structured analysis development strategy\no	Application prototope development strategy\no	Computer aided systems tools\no	Systems design\no	Design of computer output\no	Design of input and control\no	Design of online dialogue\n',1,NULL,6,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(222,'Analyzing requirements and defining solution ','Scott F. Wilson','Prentice Hall of India',2000,NULL,500,'English','','The coverage of this book includes:\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Managing enterpise development projects-team roles and processes\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Analyzing business requirements-human, technological, and organizational factors\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Conceptualizing the solution, outlining project scope, and setting goals\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Defining application architecture, development platform, and tools\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Mapping conceptual design and business requirements to logical design\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Assessing the potential impact of design on performance, maintainability, extensibility, and security\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Designing the user interface and user services\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Developing the data tier-data models and data access strategies\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Using Ms.Business-tier technologies to build components and services\nÃ¢â‚¬Â¢	Planning an appropriate deployment strategy\n',1,NULL,3,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(223,'Analyzing requirements and defining solutions','NIIT','NIIT',2000,NULL,500,'English','','Didalam buku ini terdapat penjelasan mengenai:\n1. Using MSF\n2. Implementing The team and process models\n3. Analyzing Requrements\n4. Creating data flow Diagrams\n5. creating an E/R Diagram and normalizing Tables\n6. deciding the Technology to be used\n7. Designing an Aplication\n8. Creating test cases\n9. Deployiing a system \n10. case study',1,NULL,45,NULL,'202