th COM components? WhatÃ¢â‚¬â„¢s the difference between .Net remoting and Web services? How will these changes affect the architecture and design of a distributes application?',1,NULL,9,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(944,'Diverging paths: comparing a century of Scand','Editor Magnus Blomstrom','Inter-American Development Bank',2000,NULL,500,'English','','By this book, we learn contributors outline each countries path of long-term growth and focus on key characteristic of its development. in all, the essays explore six central development related topics that explain the contrasting experiences of the two regions.',1,NULL,6,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(945,'divident policy and enterprise valuation','James E. Walter','Wadsworth',2000,NULL,500,'English','','The contents in this book:\n1. Introduction management and stockholders \n2. Cash distribution policies\n3. Fundamentals of investment value\n4. Divindens in transition\n5. Longer run Impact: Earnings stream Unaffected.\netc,',1,NULL,3,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(946,'DNA Structure and function','Richard R. Sinden','Academic Press',2000,NULL,500,'English','','DNA structure and function, a timely and comprehensive resource, is intended for any student or scientist interested in DNA structure and its biological implications. This book provides a simple yet comprehensive introduction to nearly all aspects of DNA structure. It also explains current ideas on the biological significance of classic and alternative DNA conformations.',1,NULL,3,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(947,'DNS on Windows NT','Paul Albitz','O\'Reilly & Associates',2000,NULL,500,'English','','There are several topics included in this book, such as: How does DNS work?, Where Do I Start?, Setting Up the Microsoft DNS Server, Configurating Hosts, Maintaining the Microsoft DNS Server, Growing Your Domain, Parenting, nslookup.',1,NULL,3,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 