rfect world','0','The MIT Press',2000,NULL,500,'English','','The collection of outhors in this volume reflects the impact that Stiglizt has had on the profession of economics. They include four Noble Prize winners, the president of an Ivy League University, the head of an Oxford College, the present chief economist of the World Bank, and other recognized leaders in economics from the leading universities around the world.',1,NULL,3,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(993,'Economics for policymaking','Arthur M. Okun','The MIT Press',2000,NULL,500,'English','','The essay in this volume represent the work of a truly gifted economist. Arthur M.Okun, who died suddenly at the age of 51, was one of the few members of his profession who could apply technical economic analysis to difficult policy problems, devise practical solutions to these problems, and explain his results to opinion leaders and the public in languange they can understand.',1,NULL,3,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(994,'Economics: a contemporary introduction: Third','William A. McEachern','South Western',2000,NULL,500,'English','','The parts of this book are:\n1. Introduction to economics\n2. Fundamentals of macroeconomics\n3. Fiscal and monetary policy\n4. Introduction to the market system\n5. Market structure and pricing\n6. Resource market\n7. Market failure and public policy\n8. The international setting',1,NULL,3,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(995,'Ecuador: an economic and social agenda in the','editors, Vicente Fretes- Cibils et. Al','The World Bank',2000,NULL,500,'English','','The topic in this book:\n1. Purpose and Organization\n2. Central message\n3. The development Agenda-diagnostic study and policies\n4. The vision of a new Ecuadorans and fights against Corruption\netc,',1,NULL,3,NULL,'2025-03-17 11:00:09','2025-03-17 11:00:09'),(996,'Edgar Degas: defining the modernist edge','Jennifer R. Gross','Yale University Press',2000,NULL,500,'English',